0..71 Comment "//! This source models two data families that share a constructor name."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..154 Comment "//! `Paint` and `Light` each declare `Red`. A use through the family names one"
155..200 Comment "//! constructor, so the two names never meet."
201..204 Comment "//!"
205..283 Comment "//! `Paint.Red` and `Light.Red` name the two constructors, as a value and as a"
284..350 Comment "//! pattern. `Green` stays bare, because only `Paint` declares it."
